      <title>Grok 乱码回复用户，xAI 面临可靠性考验</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260820/Grok-%E4%B9%B1%E7%A0%81%E5%9B%9E%E5%A4%8D%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7xAI-%E9%9D%A2%E4%B8%B4%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%80%A7%E8%80%83%E9%AA%8C/</link>
